    "chunk_text": "\u00e6t \u00fee gel\u00e6ste, \u00fe\u00e6t ic n\u00e6fre ma n\u00e6nne mon on \u00feisum life ne beswice and \u00fe\u00e6t ic And seo eadiga f\u00e6mne him andswarode: Gewit \u00fee heonan on weig and sea eor\u00f0e \u00fee forswelge and \u00feu And \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6s o\u00f0res d\u00e6ges se gerefa het, \u00fe\u00e6t me him \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den toforen brohte. And \u00fea seo f\u00e6mne ut of \u00fean carcerne gel\u00e6d w\u00e6s, hio hy sona seneda, \u00fea hio ut eode, and me \u00fe\u00e6r And \u00fea se gerefa to \u00fe\u00e6re f\u00e6mne cw\u00e6\u00f0: Wilt \u00feu me get geheran and to minum gode \u00fee gebiddan? And hi \u00fea andswera ageaf: Ne \u00fee, ne \u00feinum godum ic n\u00e6fre ne lufige; ac \u00fee wel gerisde, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu \u00d0a het se gerefa hio genimon and bead heom hire cla\u00f0es of niman and hi up ahon bi \u00fean fotum, and he And \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se gerefa to \u00fe\u00e6re f\u00e6mne: And nylt \u00feu me get lufian, ne to minum gode \u00fee gebugan, ne And seo eadiga f\u00e6mne nolde him andswarigen nan word. \u00d0a w\u00e6r\u00f0 se gerefa swi\u00f0e eorre and het mycel fyr on\u00e6lan and \u00e6nne cytel \u00fe\u00e6rofer gesettan and b\u00e6d And seo eadiga Margareta heo georne to gode geb\u00e6d and \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ic \u00fee wille biddan, leofa drihten And \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6r com fleogan drihtnes \u00e6ngel and he \u00fea gehalgode \u00fe\u00e6t wallende w\u00e6ter to fonte and \u00fea \u00d0a \u00fe\u00e6t geherdon and geseagon \u00fee hire ymbstodan, wundor heom \u00feuhte. Hio geherdon stef",
